# Disable Git's line-ending normalisation for every file in the pack.
#
# Why this matters: packwiz stores a hash of every file in index.toml.
# On Windows, Git converts LF to CRLF on checkout and back on commit.
# That changes the bytes, which changes the hash, which makes
# packwiz-installer report a hash mismatch for every config file your
# friends download. "-text" tells Git to leave all files byte-for-byte
# exactly as they are.

* -text
